    65→## Run from docker
    …
    67→You can run dockly using docker:
    69→```
    70→docker run -it --rm -v /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock lirantal/dockly
    71→```
    74→## Build
    …
    76→If you wish to build dockly as a docker image yourself, you can run the following:
    78→```
    79→$ docker build -t dockly .
    81→$ docker run -it --rm --name dockly -v /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock dockly
    82→```
